    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it doesn't matter who i talk to. they've all made up their minds about me. i can see it in the way they pull away or just stop replying. everything i do just makes it worse. there's no going back to how things were, and i'm just tired of pretending i can fix it. it feels like the door is just... permanently closed.",
