      "role": "user",
      "content": "i don't want to find a different space. there's nowhere else to go. i've tried going elsewhere, i've tried being quiet, i've tried everything. it's just a cycle of feeling like a mistake that everyone's tired of dealing with. honestly, part of me thinks it would just be easier if i wasn't a factor anymore. like, if everything just stopped, the silence wouldn't feel so heavy. it would just be... over.",
